Subject: [PATCH 32/53] swdtb: Allow uppercase isa string (RV64|RV32) (#139)

Signed-off-by: Leo Yu-Chi Liang <ycliang@andestech.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/u-boot.official/pulls/139
Reviewed-by: randolph <randolph@andestech.com>
Reviewed-by: Tim Shih-Ting OuYang <tim609@andestech.com>
---
 board/andestech/common/swdtb_merger/swdtb_merger_fixup.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/board/andestech/common/swdtb_merger/swdtb_merger_fixup.c b/board/andestech/common/swdtb_merger/swdtb_merger_fixup.c
index edea7c7619b5..da15fcc3c6f5 100644
--- a/board/andestech/common/swdtb_merger/swdtb_merger_fixup.c
+++ b/board/andestech/common/swdtb_merger/swdtb_merger_fixup.c
@@ -172,7 +172,7 @@ int riscv_isa_fixup(void *fdt, int node, char *name, char *value)
 		}
 
 		while (idx < strlen(old_str)) {
-			if (!strncmp(&old_str[idx], rv_str, strlen(rv_str))) {
+			if (!strncasecmp(&old_str[idx], rv_str, strlen(rv_str))) {
 				strncat(new_str, rv_str, strlen(rv_str));
 
 				idx += strlen(rv_str);
